OL,3,GNEWSAThousands respond to huge solar
OL,4,Afarm consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FMore than 2,750 people have responded
OL,7,Fto a consultation about plans to build
OL,8,Fwhat would be Europe's biggest solar
OL,9,Ffarm in South Yorkshire.
OL,11,FThe responses have been sent to the
OL,12,Fgovernment's Planning Inspectorate as
OL,13,Fpart of a complex process examining the
OL,14,Fproposals, which span areas of
OL,15,FDoncaster and Rotherham.
OL,17,FThe comments are not broken down into
OL,18,Ffor or against, but a number of parish
OL,19,Fcouncils, community groups, MPs and
OL,20,FRotherham and Doncaster councils have
OL,21,Fobjected.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,389,380,200,160,0,100
