OL,3,GNEWSAThousands respond to huge solar
OL,4,Afarm consultation
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe solar farm and battery storage was
OL,7,Foriginally projected to cover 3,500
OL,8,Facres (5.5sq miles) but applicants
OL,9,FWhitestone Net Zero said it had made
OL,10,F"significant changes to the project
OL,11,Fdesign" following two rounds of
OL,12,Fconsultation.
